{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_031_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:b0cbb674fec62b77f909d0804ff67c53b90604bbbbb6c60d1b29052bba58f67c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5a3bef0a57251aa0ef5822371e38f8ded594916ce859acc11eb1b62087097cf8",
      "text": "啊，找到你啦！\n●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:266b85541d466d229c0133e1b8e8604080f545a90ca98d500992c49a4c79b763",
      "text": "我把情人节的回礼带来啦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e5a9c3c9a54ac4454d666d35fa904ee23cfefb70910714202070adaed61d25",
      "text": "从制作人那里收到巧克力的时候，\n我真的超级超级开心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f65f53fdd9c5bf86919dce92611cc81458a4b0dc18216d7414bce9f664e9d60f",
      "text": "所以我也想让制作人体验到幸福咲的心情，\n超努力地挑选了哦～♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ec1e5c48ce20bb4fa1814f86c7fc587efb1fc1d94d7ffe54f76098623f17f6a",
      "text": "我的这份心意，你能收下的话我会很高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5068f392de9168772303a1f6a8c6873d24c1778993d7392aba08e7f6df31dc5f",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー，\n突然把你叫出来真不好意思呢～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3216b8f0848ff897775a5107ee46b4f2a9c8b8551770b5b1eb9269712247a29",
      "text": "我有想送给制作人的东西呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b001ab778a452ff98f60b2e8e394b5c3e551e5c5542cb20fcb025c650b7c4fcd",
      "text": "来，请收下，这是送给●●●●プロデューサー的\n白色情人节回礼♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85e5522b7031b2418c1e1933c728611da84728dc540aaa2438965f3e563d2ecb",
      "text": "因为想送的东西实在太多了，\n决定挑哪一个真是花了好一番工夫呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2bd50d13761a9e481619cbc725805606a49006e541e4e2f677e61e6aa13fa0b",
      "text": "一边琢磨了好多一边挑出来的哦☆\n要是能合你心意就好啦～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000042:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f9faea8aef70e11dde3baa300a453c7cc473fc00be670c9796a601cb07aee4d",
      "text": "谢谢你送我这么棒的回礼",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000043:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9782c4323680d1e982c10a8681155f170f717d89dce54c0431283fab32583129",
      "text": "能收到咲小姐的礼物，我非常高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cefae89d8a5524989890a5a513da849a03d3d5d72b33b8227150d0674becc510",
      "text": "嘿嘿，你能高兴太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cefae89d8a5524989890a5a513da849a03d3d5d72b33b8227150d0674becc510",
      "text": "嘿嘿，你能高兴太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b995a58382abe09342f6ed96c882abfd4635c82200b44b49dda28e7b38f4ec9",
      "text": "我收到情人节巧克力的时候，\n也是超——级开心的哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:548985ee1df4cca508c61b99943f327d6bf8a6ac4ff891bd5e7cdf28a611385c",
      "text": "拍的照片我简直每天都在翻看呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_031_22:5_02_031_22_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dab5105c3d2a1b8b40c0cfa304e41fdef423f42d166134dc62352a9a0d0880e2",
      "text": "所以，要是制作人也能感受到和我当时一样多的\n喜悦的话，我会很高兴的♪",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
